commit 5c6955c493a0c338a90f00c56119f4383b3e7e3e

C03: a clock final may say the application was opened when the mission really opened it (APPS1391)

APPS1387 measured «abrí la calculadora y decime qué hora es»: the mind now composed «Abrí la calculadora y son las 05:46.», and the App rejected it three times as missing_literal_fact because InventedAppEffectOnClock treats any «abrí » in a clock final as an invented app effect; the English «I opened the calculator. The time is 05:48.» passed because its markers differ.

Baxy.App UserMessagePolicy: InventedAppEffectOnClock is skipped when the structured mission source carries a step with operation app.open that succeeded or was verified (MissionOpenedAnApplication). Pure clock requests keep the guard.

Mind unchanged. Tests not run (owner order). App recompiled in BUILD1391.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


